1
00:00:00,099 --> 00:00:10,220
(dramatic music plays)

2
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:14,879
When all was hushed and dimmed by sorrow.

3
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:20,159
And silence wrapped the aching years.

4
00:00:20,799 --> 00:00:25,399
A single breath invoked tomorrow.

5
00:00:26,059 --> 00:00:30,520
