splendoris flamma vivens!. Ecce

10
00:00:47,299 --> 00:00:51,740
novus Novus ordo in floribus!.

11
00:00:53,259 --> 00:01:00,040
(instrumental music plays)

12
00:01:00,059 --> 00:01:04,659
Oh, splendor rise from embers deep.

13
00:01:05,619 --> 00:01:09,860
Like roses blooming after sleep.

14
00:01:10,879 --> 00:01:15,439
You are the song that grief forgets.

15
00:01:16,180 --> 00:01:20,959
